        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Amend the plan to change the participant contribution structure from one based on $5 increments to a percentage-based structure. The employer match would remain at 66-2/3% of the amount of the Pretax Matched Contributions and After-Tax Matched Contributions, which would be limited in the aggregate to 6% of eligible compensation per pay period.",
